{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2022-12-21 16:15:00', 'title': 'UNDER ARMOUR ANNOUNCES STEPHANIE LINNARTZ AS PRESIDENT AND CEO', 'text': "BALTIMORE , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/\xa0--\xa0UNDER ARMOUR, INC. (NYSE: UA, UAA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT STEPHANIE LINNARTZ WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS PRESIDENT, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND MEMBER OF ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 27, 2023. HER APPOINTMENT FOLLOWS A THOROUGH AND DELIBERATE SEARCH LED BY A COMMITTEE OF INDEPENDENT MEMBERS OF UNDER ARMOUR'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS."}